              "text": "Each Party's obligation under Subparagraphs 7.1 and 7.2 to bear Capital Costs and O&M Costs in the proportions set forth in Schedule B is limited to the then-current twelve (12) month period, and a Party may reduce those proportions on not less than thirty (30) days' prior written notice to the CBP. Any resulting shortfall shall be settled by a true-up of the costs actually incurred to the effective date of the reduction, and no penalty or forfeiture shall apply."
